  "idea": "Async peer recognition bot that rewards teammates in public Slack channels",
  "text": "How top remote teams celebrate wins and give shoutouts across different departments. In distributed companies, exceptional employee contributions often remain completely invisible to executives and other remote teams. When hard work goes unnoticed, top performers disengage, leading to quiet quitting and expensive engineering turnover. Integrating HeyTaco directly into public Slack channels lets coworkers award redeemable tacos for helpful cross-functional support. You boost company morale and retain top talent.",
